Your classmate: I’m so tired. I was up until midnight finishing my homework again.
You: Oh no! {{1}}
Your classmate: Maths, English and a long history project. It’s too much for one night.
You: I agree. And {{2}}?
Your classmate: About three hours, but sometimes more when I have a test.
You: That’s a lot. {{3}}
Your classmate: I don’t think so. I’m too busy and I don’t have time to play football any more.
You: Maybe we should talk to our teacher. {{4}}
Your classmate: Good idea! Do you think she will listen to us?
You: I hope so. Do you know {{5}}?
Your classmate: She is usually in the classroom after lunch, so we can go then.
Your classmate: Thanks for helping me. You’re a good friend.
You: {{6}}
